				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">These are some of the screenshots I took at Dariana's memorable party along the shores of the Serpant River in Karana.
<br />

<br />
I will add more as I get them <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://darkinheritance.com/pics/dariparty/start.jpg" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
In attendance was Dariana, Raiya, Cemberfrost, Meneltel and Fubarz.
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://darkinheritance.com/pics/dariparty/trio.jpg" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
Serrik, Raiya and Fubarz were not quite feeling themselves  <img src="images/smiles/icon_twisted.gif" alt="icon_twisted.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://darkinheritance.com/pics/dariparty/fireworks1.jpg" border="0" />
<br />
<img src="http://darkinheritance.com/pics/dariparty/fireworks2.jpg" border="0" />
<br />
<img src="http://darkinheritance.com/pics/dariparty/fireworks1.jpg" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
Wobygon (spelling?), a gnomish inventor and friend of Dariana put on a fireworks show that was incredible.
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://darkinheritance.com/pics/dariparty/raiyafubsduel.jpg" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
After the fireworks and trivia contest (Won by Cemberfrost - and we do not dare ask how he knew the answer to one question so readily), Raiya and Fubarz dueled, followed by Cember and Dariana, and then Raiya and Serrik <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /><br />_________________<br /><img src="http://darkinheritance.com/serrik/SerrikSig3.jpg" border="0" />
<br />
55th Season Monk of Dark Inheritance
<br />
Baron Serrik Ryuujin - Proud Husband of the Lady Raiya
<br />
<span style="font-style: italic">She is the holder of my heart and the delight of my eyes</span></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
